- **Verification API endpoints do not match required paths**: required were `GET /api/users/{id}/verification-status` and `POST /api/admin/users/{id}/verify`. Implemented endpoints are under `/api/verification/...` (`/users/<id>/status`, `/admin/verify/<id>`), so clients expecting the specified contracts will fail.
- **Health check payload mismatch**: done criteria specifies `/api/health -> {"status":"healthy"}`. Current response includes extra field (`{"status":"healthy","app":"VipChat"}`), which may fail strict contract checks.
- **UI coverage incomplete vs requirements**: badge was added in chat list, chat header, profile panel, and contact info, but no evidence of addition in **group member lists**.
- **CRA dependency fix is risky/inconclusive**: replacing direct deps with global `overrides` for `ajv`/`ajv-keywords` and removing nested Ajv v6 entries may not be compatible with parts of CRA’s toolchain that still expect Ajv v6 APIs. No evidence in diff that `npm start` was validated successfully.

